    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.0 (345)</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:24:56 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's New in Variator 0.3.0 (Build 345)</h2>
<p>This update hardens diagnostics telemetry synchronization, enhances git push resilience during concurrent fleet device sync, and resolves UI button label wrapping across footers and modal sheets.</p>

<h3>🛡️ Fixed Diagnostics Sync</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>SSH Deploy Key Permissions:</strong> SSH deploy key now enforced with strict <code>0600</code> POSIX permissions in Application Support to prevent permission denied rejections by OpenSSH.</li>
  <li><strong>Unattended Sync Reliability:</strong> Eliminates SSH authentication errors and guarantees consistent, automated telemetry upload across fleet devices.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🔄 Enhanced Push Resilience</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Automatic Rebase Retry:</strong> Added automatic rebase retry before git push to cleanly handle concurrent device sync.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Non-Fast-Forward Collisions:</strong> Seamlessly synchronizes remote diagnostic branches before pushing, preventing rejection during concurrent fleet updates.</li>
</ul>

<h3>✨ UI Layout Anti-Wrapping</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Cancel Button Label Protection:</strong> Prevented 'Cancel' button labels from wrapping letter-by-letter in rendering footers and modal sheets.</li>
  <li><strong>Layout Stability:</strong> Enforced robust single-line constraints to preserve clean, unclipped action buttons across all window and sheet dimensions.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
