    <item>
      <title>Version 0.3.0 (343)</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 15:09:45 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h2>What's New in Build 343</h2>
<p>This update brings essential stability fixes, powerful batch queue multi-selection, automatic storage permission recovery, and major UI refinements.</p>

<h3>🎯 Queue Multi-Select & Batch Re-run</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>History Multi-Selection:</strong> Select individual or multiple completed jobs in the History tab with new checkboxes and live selection counters.</li>
  <li><strong>Instant Re-run:</strong> Re-enqueue selected historical jobs directly into the active render queue with one click via <em>Re-run Selected (N)</em>.</li>
  <li><strong>Clearer Folder Picker:</strong> Export directory dialog now explicitly prompts <em>Set Export Destination</em> to eliminate file-vs-folder confusion.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🛡️ Storage & Permission Resilience</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>3-Tier Fallback:</strong> Automatically falls back to Caches or Temporary storage if Application Support has restricted permissions.</li>
  <li><strong>Active Write-Probe:</strong> Pre-tests disk write access before starting exports to prevent mid-render permission crashes.</li>
  <li><strong>Permission Repair Tool:</strong> Includes a one-click macOS repair command (<code>Fix_Variator_Permissions.command</code>) to restore folder permissions.</li>
</ul>

<h3>✨ UI Polish & Timeline</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Docked Scene Timeline:</strong> Timeline is cleanly positioned directly below the video viewport with high-contrast scene markers.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Letter-Wrapping:</strong> Strict single-line constraints prevent button and badge text clipping across all window sizes.</li>
  <li><strong>Deactivated Inactive Controls:</strong> Unused tracking buttons are disabled cleanly to eliminate confusing click targets.</li>
  <li><strong>English Localization:</strong> All remaining UI strings, alerts, and badges standardized to clean English.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🔊 Audio & Pipeline Stability</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Voice Separation Fallback:</strong> Gracefully falls back when vocal isolation models are unavailable without aborting the render.</li>
  <li><strong>Flexible Transitions:</strong> Safe deserialization handles custom scene transitions without decode failures.</li>
  <li><strong>Log Throttling:</strong> Diagnostics stream capped to 512 KB to prevent disk and memory bloat during batch exports.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🚀 Sparkle Auto-Update Invariants</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Universal Version Fallback:</strong> Seamless update path for clients on any prior build (Build 326, 327, 328, 329, 330).</li>
  <li><strong>Full Runtime Restoration:</strong> Delivers complete standalone bundle with all bundled binaries, ffmpeg, and node runtime.</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
